{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/9282585ee79ee518631916a772fbb368.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived at Taichin XI, one of the moons of the planet Teptes, looking for rare resources. You've soon discovered that you are not alone. The mining operations have disturbed the insectoid aliens living deep underground and they are coming for you. Deploy automated defenses and prepare for the nightfall. Defend your HQ at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/9461315aab195e0c158abf8ee8173c30.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you prepare the right strategy to survive? or will you succumb to the relentless onslaught of the horde?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/4ca8b75b273763bafc3e151f3ad11534.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build tech plants and unlock powerful end game turrets to deal with the toughest of the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unearthened is a classic Idle tower defense game where the player builds turrets to defend his base from the attacking alien hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player needs to build and develop a sustainable mining base that can generate enough profits to build defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/976cfde2996403786bcb1b8e5e12e322.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build turrets and support structures and get ready to defend from the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and unlock new turrets and upgrades.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game achievements that actually are useful in unlocking powerful permanent upgrades for turrets and buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated map making the game fresh every new start.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7ae9d2b9fd23681ea6b67c899b320243.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7b4222898fa56cd7ebe7079fc306f854.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7b4222898fa56cd7ebe7079fc306f854.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7b4222898fa56cd7ebe7079fc306f854.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/554adc88d824d9b3d1864ee704be0895.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/317613f8fc8611b58f1a44784c629c21.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/317613f8fc8611b58f1a44784c629c21.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/317613f8fc8611b58f1a44784c629c21.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/6c2b610b3ff8d4bb80ff4ffa0c4ff6bef9e34f2e.jpg"},{"name":"Adapt Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/110dd360e57564fa01bca015bd7bbfa10855d9f5.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/dd199de04065927137a615a61e9e3439cdf69ad8.jpg"},{"name":"Master Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/e911599a5e85ace63d54bbf4e54bc06ee6d487db.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/b3f34190a5a5f744885ddf01f1f4384034f30d27.jpg"},{"name":"Adapt Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/cf6824cd6bbc42b6ee4dad181cc5d2f171115996.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/206a5da8673420ae917c0ebc5d8413808fe0993b.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Capitalist ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/f7bc52e81b70fedc0a56ff1fec8f039d20141de4.jpg"},{"name":"Adapt Capitalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/4e4be2685876170c202addb9661457fa4eb7e3a4.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran Capitalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1847250/dca2638c8144eb4cf1b2664f7f9599f9906b510f.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1847250?t=1765218568","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765218568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/fd628adf03632111254847dd1eff30feeb2827cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765218568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/fd628adf03632111254847dd1eff30feeb2827cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765218568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>COMPLETE EDITION</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s New in The Unearthened: Complete Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Complete Edition brings the biggest upgrade the game has ever received. Enjoy a fully reworked experience featuring:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Titans of the Taichin XI \u2014 DLC Included Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Complete Edition includes the <strong>Titans of the Taichin XI</strong> DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>4 colossal boss monsters</strong> that emerge from the depths of Taichin XI.<br>Each Titan can push your defenses to their absolute limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Multi-Slot Save System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save anytime</strong> during your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick restart for a better map seed</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Reworked Map Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized resource node placements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworked map visuals and resource node visuals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Steam Achievements &amp; Stat Tracking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New steam achievements and stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced achievement bonuses</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Massively Improved Pacing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Significantly reduced grind, improved pacing and made a lot of balance changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Quality-of-Life Improvements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New settings, better tooltips and dozens of small enhancements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Game Modes &amp; Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Randomizer Mode, Longer Nights mode and Dark Planet mode for players seeking a tougher challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Countless Bug Fixes &amp; Stability Improvements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stable, more polished, and more reliable than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New building visuals and effects.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/9282585ee79ee518631916a772fbb368.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/77da47ce815bd54c9651b7044cf31a69.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived at Taichin XI, one of the moons of the planet Teptes, looking for rare resources. You've soon discovered that you are not alone. The mining operations have disturbed the insectoid aliens living deep underground and they are coming for you. Deploy automated defenses and prepare for the nightfall. Defend your HQ at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/e505674dfecd5ff7e775c40c1faa868c.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/9461315aab195e0c158abf8ee8173c30.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you prepare the right strategy to survive? or will you succumb to the relentless onslaught of the horde?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/4ca8b75b273763bafc3e151f3ad11534.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7680ecac4a26956ab36c6e7b4d44bfdd.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build tech plants and unlock powerful end game turrets to deal with the toughest of the horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unearthened is a classic Idle tower defense game where the player builds turrets to defend his base from the attacking alien hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player needs to build and develop a sustainable mining base that can generate enough profits to build defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/dada2b5d1ef21c76e7a77aacdad98ed4.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/976cfde2996403786bcb1b8e5e12e322.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build turrets and support structures and get ready to defend from the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and unlock new turrets and upgrades.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game achievements that actually are useful in unlocking powerful permanent upgrades for turrets and buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated map making the game fresh every new start.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/7ae9d2b9fd23681ea6b67c899b320243.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/12d5a4d673c2584f158e8ee9bd3072c9.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.poster.avif?t=1765218568\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.webm?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1847250/extras/c1e3cc61095b226cfc568f5141338ae1.mp4?t=1765218568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class